  "solution": "**GIVEN:**\n\nx + (1)/(x) = -2√ 3 \n\n**FORMULA USED:**\n\n (x + (1)/(x))² = x2 + (1)/(x²) + 2 × x × (1)/(x) = x2 + (1)/(x²) + 2\n\n (x + (1)/(x))³ = x³ + (1)/(x³) + 3 × x × (1)/(x) × (x + (1)/(x)) = x³ + (1)/(x³)** **+ 3 ×** **(- 2√3 )\n\n**CALCULATION:**\n\n(- 2√3 )² = x² + (1)/(x²) +** **2\n\n⇒ 10 = x2 + (1)/(x²) ----(1)\n\nNow, (- 2√3)³ = x³ + (1)/(x³) - 6√3\n\n⇒ - 24√3 + 6√3 = x3 + (1)/(x³)\n\n⇒ - 18√3 = x3 + (1)/(x³) ----(2)\n\nNow, \n\n⇒ (x⁵ + (1)/(x⁵)) = (x2 + (1)/(x²))( x3 + (1)/(x³) ) - (x + (1)/(x) ) \n\n⇒ (x5 + (1)/(x⁵)) = 10 × -18√3 - (-2√3) = - 178√3.\n\n**∴ The value of ** **(x5 + **(1)/(x⁵)**) is -178√3.**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] **__Shortcut Trick__** If x + (1)/(x) = p, then x⁵ + (1)/(x⁵) = (p² - 2)(p³ - 3p) - p\n\n If x + (1)/(x) = -2√3, then x⁵ + (1)/(x⁵) = {(-2√3)² - 2}{(-2√3)³ -\n\n3(-2√3)} - (-2√3) = (12 - 2)(-24√3 + 6√3) - (-2√3) =\n\n10 × -18√3 + 2√3 = -180√3 + 2√3 = -178√3.",
